 - `app.bind {path, preview}`: bind the active document's File > Save to a host-owned `.pcraft` project and `.png` render under the automation write root. Other documents retain normal Save behavior.
 - `app.handoff {}`: hosted protocol capabilities (`version: 2`, `replace: true`, `hiddenStart: true`). Hosts must check this before opening a document. Launch desktop with `--hosted` to create its native window hidden until the owner embeds and shows it.
